ns1:CA_Task203_C09_Assessment a ns1:CompetenceActivation ;
    dcterms:description "Contextual predominant Bloom levels recorded by the source: Apply;Analyze. These qualify documented activation and do not replace reference KnowledgeSkill levels."@en,
