    skos:scopeNote "Source disposition details are Analytical Rigor, Responsibility to Formal Consistency, Reflective Reasoning and Collaborative Reasoning. The last three are represented by the existing responsible, reflective and collaborative orientations in this formal-grammar context. Verb allocation to individual pairings is a local interpretation of the source action list."@en ;
